Subject: [PATCH] Add church calendar and messaging features to admin dashboard

Calendar feature:
- Monthly grid view with color-coded event categories
- Full CRUD for events with title, date, time, location, category
- Interactive calendar with click-to-edit events
- Events table listing below calendar

Church messaging feature:
- Three send modes: broadcast, direct, email blast
- Message history with filter tabs
- View message details in modal
- Integrates with existing email notification system

Infrastructure:
- New calendar_events and church_messages tables in schema.sql
- RESTful API endpoints matching existing patterns
- Updated sidebar navigation across all admin views

